{{!-- Bonus GRIT-cell block (Фокус, renamed to "GRIT") — a flat total, no armor involved:
     a Character's own base pool (GOD.BASE_GRIT/system.baseGrit), or an NPC's GM-set
     NPCDataModel.gritMax. Shared by the Character and NPC sheets, and rendered standalone
     by #patchGritTrack() (actor-sheet.mjs/npc-sheet.mjs) so click/crack/repair/max-±
     actions can patch just this block instead of re-rendering the whole sheet.

     Numeric counter, no text label (2026-08-24 — the mask icon alone stands in for the
     old "GRIT" caption, see its own data-tooltip below). Direct click-on-the-number
     interaction, no buttons: LMB on the whole-value spends one point, RMB restores one;
     LMB on the max lowers the pool by one, RMB raises it — same scheme on both fields,
     always live (not gated behind edit mode, unlike the old +/- buttons it replaces).
     The cracked indicator is its own small always-visible badge (dim at 0, red once
     something's actually broken) so its own LMB-repair/RMB-break gestures never collide
     with the whole/max fields' meanings. See #onGritWholeClick/#onGritWholeContextMenu/
     #onGritMaxClick/#onGritMaxContextMenu/#onGritCrackRepairClick/#onGritCrackBreakClick
     in actor-sheet.mjs/npc-sheet.mjs.

     Guard is "has at least one cell OR we're in edit mode" (not hasGrit alone) — an NPC
     with gritMax still at 0 has nothing to show, but edit mode still needs the block to
     exist so its max field is reachable (RMB) to raise it off 0 in the first place;
     outside edit mode with zero cells there's nothing to click at all, so it's hidden. --}}
{{#if (or gritTrack.hasGrit editMode)}}
<div class="grit-track">
  <div class="grit-counter-row">
    <i class="grit-icon-badge" data-tooltip="GRIT" data-tooltip-direction="UP"></i>
    <span class="grit-counter-value" data-tooltip="ЛКМ — потратить, ПКМ — восстановить" data-tooltip-direction="UP">{{gritTrack.whole}}</span>
    <span class="grit-counter-sep">/</span>
    <span class="grit-counter-max" data-tooltip="ЛКМ — уменьшить максимум, ПКМ — увеличить" data-tooltip-direction="UP">{{gritTrack.count}}</span>
    <span class="grit-cracked-indicator{{#if gritTrack.cracked}} has-cracked{{/if}}" data-tooltip="Треснуло: {{gritTrack.cracked}} — ЛКМ чинит, ПКМ ломает" data-tooltip-direction="UP">
      <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i>{{gritTrack.cracked}}
    </span>
  </div>
</div>
{{/if}}
